<title>UK: Safeway eases amid market share worries.</title>
<headline>Safeway eases amid market share worries.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Safeway Plc eased on Thursday after an industry report showed that the UK supermarket chain's market share was lagging behind that of its competitors, dealers and analysts said.</p>
<p>At 0933 GMT, the shares were down 5p to 341; more than 1.9 million shares changed hands.</p>
